.DS_Store

# AI session logs (never commit). Scoped to the repo root on purpose: the same
# basename pattern used to match docs/superpowers/**, which silently excluded the
# approved design spec and the roadmap plans that tracked documents cite.
2026*.md

# Superseded root drafts. Kept out of git but still cited by AGENTS.md and
# CODEBASE_AUDIT.md; they are force-added so a fresh clone is not missing files
# that tracked documentation points at.
IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
BUILD-SUMMARY.md
TECH-DOC.md

# The approved spec and its plans are tracked. Any future date-stamped draft
# under docs/superpowers/ is a deliberate decision, not an accident of naming.
# Local agent tooling state (per-machine, never shared)
.claude/
.mimocode/

# Generated knowledge-graph output. Rebuilt by `graphify update .`; the tracked
# contract is the code, not the cache.
graphify-out/

# Ad-hoc log snippets pasted while debugging. Not project source; kept locally.
# audit_raw.json is an ~900KB raw agent session transcript, also kept locally.
# Delete these freely - nothing depends on them.
3560kdx.txt
r1161nr.txt
message.txt
message (*).txt
message*.txt
audit_raw.json
